        <activityName xml:lang="en">Uranium open pit mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Uranium open pit mine
This infrastructure module is based on the definition given in the US DOE reference for a model mine representing US conditions: U3O8 grade 0.2%;
UUID: 62090792-a2cc-3939-a09b-4749eb63cdae
This module includes the material requirements for the entire lifetime of the mine. Also the transport of these materials and the land use of the mine are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average conditions in early 1980s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_62090792-a2cc-3939-a09b-4749eb63cdae.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
